#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""EPICC — Epigenetic Pipeline for Integrative Chromatin Characterization.

User-friendly CLI wrapper around the EPICC Snakemake pipeline.

Usage:
    epicc run [options] [-- SNAKEMAKE_ARGS...]
    epicc validate [options]
    epicc output --plot-type TYPE --input-file PATH [options]
    epicc perf [--single | LOGFILE] [--html FILE]
    epicc clean [--intermediates] [--conda-envs] [--logs] [--all]

For a dry-run, prefer ``epicc validate`` (parses the config + sample sheet
and surfaces a concise summary) or pass --dry-run through to snakemake
via ``epicc run -- --dry-run`` for the raw output.
"""

